    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        187.95372009277344,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Systematic review",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        526.9635620117188,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "A total of 27 studies were identified that met inclusion criteria, of which 21 were sampled for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        526.9039916992188,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "inclusion in the analysis. All of the sampled studies were published between 2012 and 2020.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.56519317626953,
        526.904052734375,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Of the 21 included studies, 18 were located in high TB burden countries: six in India, four in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.065185546875,
        526.9067993164062,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "South Africa, two each in Kenya and Uganda, and one each in Brazil, Cambodia, Myanmar and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992347717285156,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.565185546875,
        526.9920043945312,
        170.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Viet Nam. One study covered projects in nine countries (Bangladesh, Cambodia, Democratic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.065185546875,
        526.8931274414062,
        186.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Republic of the Congo, Kenya, Malawi, Moldova, Mozambique, Nepal and Pakistan). In addition,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.945615768432617,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        188.565185546875,
        527.3397827148438,
        201.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "there was one study located in Eswatini, one in Mongolia and one in Nepal. All studies focused",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98889446258545,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        204.065185546875,
        480.97216796875,
        217.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "on Xpert MTB/RIF, except for one that focused on Xpert MTB/RIF Ultra (Xpert Ultra).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.069091796875,
        527.0248413085938,
        241.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "A summary of the core characteristics of studies included in this review is presented in a study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        243.569091796875,
        526.9761962890625,
        256.714111328125
      ],
      "text": "characteristics table in  Web Annex B.13: User perspectives on NAATs to detect TB and DR-TB:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.069091796875,
        365.8489074707031,
        272.214111328125
      ],
      "text": ". results from qualitative evidence synthesis: systematic review",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.5808410644531,
        139.52069091796875,
        300.9608154296875
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.21173095703125,
        527.2131958007812,
        324.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "The aim of the interviews was to understand participants’ experiences of using the various",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.7117004394531,
        526.7613525390625,
        339.8567199707031
      ],
      "text": "technologies (i.e. NAATs for detection of TB and TB drug resistance) and their general TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.2117004394531,
        526.9149169921875,
        355.3567199707031
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic experiences. The three countries – India, Moldova and South Africa – were selected",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.7117004394531,
        526.9695434570312,
        370.8567199707031
      ],
      "text": "based on them being on WHO’s list of 30 high MDR-TB burden countries   and that index tests  (1)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951994895935059,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.2117004394531,
        527.008544921875,
        386.3567199707031
      ],
      "text": "have been used to some extent in research contexts within these countries. Due to the short",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        388.7117004394531,
        526.9138793945312,
        401.8567199707031
      ],
      "text": "time frame, participants were purposively sampled and approached based on convenience",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.2117004394531,
        279.0496826171875,
        417.3567199707031
      ],
      "text": "through personal contacts and colleagues.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.2156066894531,
        526.928466796875,
        441.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "An overview of the participants is given in   To mask the identity of study participants  Table 2.1.2.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.7156066894531,
        526.9481811523438,
        456.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "they were coded by their country (Moldova [M], India [I] or South Africa [S]), their profession",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.2156066894531,
        526.9921264648438,
        472.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "(clinician or medical doctor [M], patient advocate/representative [R], laboratory personnel [L]",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.7156066894531,
        273.8797607421875,
        487.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "or programme officers [P]) and a number.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.5018310546875,
        454.3020324707031,
        516.58984375
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.1.2.3 Overview of participants for the end-users’ interviews",
