      "text": "a 2 2 1 Programme officers",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.4950561523438,
        241.20452880859375,
        653.265869140625
      ],
      "text": "a  Participants were interviewed as a group.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.7742309570312,
        479.08123779296875,
        681.9192504882812
      ],
      "text": "Interviews were conducted using Zoom, Skype or phone. Topics discussed included:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.5262451171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        701.6712646484375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        688.5262451171875,
        527.0963134765625,
        701.6712646484375
      ],
      "text": "current approach to diagnosing TB, MDR-TB and extensively drug-resistant TB (XDR-TB),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        704.0261840820312,
        227.04766845703125,
        717.1712036132812
      ],
      "text": "including specific challenges;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.5261840820312,
        78.81909942626953,
        732.6712036132812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        719.5261840820312,
        526.964111328125,
        732.6712036132812
      ],
      "text": "experiences with using molecular TB diagnostics and the index tests specifically, including",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        735.0261840820312,
        317.5647277832031,
        748.1712036132812
      ],
      "text": "details on steps taken in the diagnostic process;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        750.5261840820312,
        78.81909942626953,
        763.6712036132812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        750.5261840820312,
        526.5916748046875,
        763.6712036132812
      ],
      "text": "experiences with determining eligibility and treatment initiation, and challenges and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        766.0261840820312,
        243.58010864257812,
        779.1712036132812
      ],
      "text": "benefits of using the index tests;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
